# Config coordination (`astro.config.mjs`, `src/content.config.ts`)

- **`astro.config.mjs`:** Tailwind via Vite (`@tailwindcss/vite`), integrations `sitemap()` and `mdx()`, `site` URL, markdown/Shiki options. Changing `site` affects sitemap and absolute URLs — update `Seo.astro` / RSS placeholders in the same customization pass when going to production.
- **`src/content.config.ts`:** defines all `collections` keys (`helpcenter`, `changelog`, `infopages`, `integrations`, `team`, `posts`, `customers`). Renaming a collection or its `base` path requires updates to every `getCollection("...")` and `getEntry("...", ...)` usage across `src/pages/` and `src/layouts/`.
- **Schema changes:** adding required Zod fields breaks existing MD files until they are filled in; prefer optional fields or migrate all entries together.
- Do not add Astro integrations or Vite plugins that are not already dependencies in `package.json` without installing them.
